# ni'o lo jicmu selnibli (The Syllogism — book Chapter 19's minimal worked example)
#
# Three plain statements. The engine compiles each to first-order logic and the
# query below is answered by two hops of backward chaining — with the full
# derivation attached. This is the smallest possible hallucination firewall.
#
# Source (what a human wrote):
#   All dogs are animals.
#   All animals eat.
#   Adam is a dog.

# All dogs are animals.
ro lo gerku cu danlu
# All animals eat.
ro lo danlu cu citka
# Adam is a dog.
la .adam. cu gerku
